# profile.local.fish — machine-local secrets and overrides.
#
# install.sh copies this template to ~/.config/fish/profile.local.fish if you
# don't already have one (seed-if-absent; reinstalls never clobber it).
# conf.d/00-core.fish sources profile.local.fish on startup (if present).
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE and is tracked in git. Your real profile.local.fish
# is NOT tracked — put actual secret values there, never here.

# GitHub personal access token for MCP / gh tooling.
# With the gh Module installed this is derived from `gh auth token` (keyring)
# automatically — leave it commented out. Uncomment only to override with a
# specific PAT (generate at https://github.com/settings/tokens).
#set -gx GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN "github_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
